==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[dragon]]'s [[blood]]|-}}

# A bright [[red]] [[resin]], obtained from different species of a number of distinct [[plant]]s {{taxlink|Calamus rotang|species}} and genera ''[[Croton]]'', ''[[Dracaena]]'', {{taxlink|Daemonorops|genus}}, and ''[[Pterocarpus]]'', used in the manufacture of [[varnish]]es, [[lacquer]]s, [[medicine]]s, and [[incense]]s.

